// PE1 supply, PE2 return. data_convert already scales pressures from MPa to бар (× 10) and splits the bit words
// into 0/1 values; its threshold names count the supply as TE1 and the return as TE2.
// Delay, warm-up and integral units are not specified by the exported flow.
// PLC commands below are read-only feedback, not commands sent by this collector.
const payload = msg.payload;

